    <string name="about_add_model_title">How to Add New Models</string>
    <string name="about_add_model_body">1. Create a folder on your phone, e.g. /sdcard/models/ and put the model folder in it.\n2. Name the model folder with a "models-" prefix and include the scale in the file name, e.g. models-Real-4x-UltraSharp, models-MNN/xxx-x4.mnn (scale like x2/x3/x4 or up2x/up3x).\n3. Go to Settings -> enter the folder path in "Path for custom models", then save.\n4. Back to Home, the new models will appear in the model list automatically.</string>
